      "description": "Skullclamp's `{1}: Equip` on any 1-toughness creature converts a token into 2 cards when it dies. Bitterblossom (1/1 faerie), Ophiomancer (1/1 snake), Infestation Sage (1/1 elf → 1/1 BG flying insect on death), Awakening Zone spawn (0/1), Sprout Swarm saprolings — every one of these is a 2-card draw with Skullclamp.",
